kubeos-dashboard (0.1.0-7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Deleting an etcd snapshot from the dashboard now works in a browser. The page issues the
    delete as HTTP DELETE, but the console's CORS preflight advertised only
    "POST, PUT, GET, OPTIONS" - so the browser refused to send the request and the page showed
    "Failed to fetch", with nothing reaching the service at all (measured 2026-11-20: the
    console journal had no DELETE from the browser, while the same call from curl - which
    ignores CORS - deleted the file perfectly). DELETE is now in the advertised list.

